{
 "_rule": "Commissioning registry (author 2026-10-15: 'The code should not allow us to commission anything without a verification that all the correct docs have been updated'). Every results-register entry of kind 'commissioning' must appear here, with every required place (kinds: note, chain, report, sop, sop_full, om, status, book, book_status, catalogue, readme), each a file and a pattern that must be found; 'forbid' lists stale statements that must not remain. CANON/commissioning_check.py runs in checked_push.sh; a missing place or a stale statement refuses the push.",
